expect(wine_posix_adapter_errno_name(2)).to_equal("ENOENT")
expect(wine_posix_adapter_errno_name(11)).to_equal("EAGAIN")
expect(wine_posix_adapter_errno_name(9999)).to_equal("EUNKNOWN")
```

